    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000702/2010007020310"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007020320,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "──でも、大丈夫です\r\nちゃんと答えを出せると思います",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000702/2010007020320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007020330,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "チョコアイドル・園田智代子\r\nレベルアップまで、もう少しだけお待ちください──です！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000702/2010007020330"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こんなこと、言われなくてもわかってると思うんだが、\r\nその……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007020340,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "いえ！　気にかけてくださってありがとうございます、\r\nプロデューサーさん！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000702/2010007020340"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……やっぱり杞憂だったな\r\nほんとにすまん、邪魔して",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007020350,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そんな、とんでもないです……！\r\n心配してもらえるのはあったかいですから",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000702/2010007020350"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007020360,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "心配させちゃう自分は\r\nまだまだだなって思っちゃいますけどね……！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
